      "title": {
        "en": "Warm and compassionate clinic team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners broadly praise the veterinary staff and front desk personnel for their gentle bedside manner and clear communication. Reviewers frequently mention Dr. Cortez, Dr. Chiang, and Dr. Braham for explaining diagnostic options patiently. Clients note that veterinarians take time during examinations without rushing appointments."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 15,
      "title": {
        "en": "Thoughtful comfort for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize how tenderly the clinic team accommodates fearful or sensitive dogs and cats. Staff members offer specialized treats, toys, and quiet exam room accommodations to reduce tension during visits. Owners of senior pets and reactive animals express gratitude for the comforting atmosphere during both checkups and end-of-life care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 5,
      "title": {
        "en": "Medical outcomes with equipment limitations"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most clients report successful outcomes for routine health checks, allergy shots, dental extractions, and senior pet care plans. However, one owner shared disappointment regarding limited on-site diagnostic equipment, noting that certain tests required outside laboratory processing and created diagnostic delays."
      }
    }
  ],
